<section class="s_title o_colored_level ri-bg-white pt64 pb40" data-snippet="s_title" data-name="Title">
  <div class="container s_allow_columns">
    <span class="ri-eyebrow">FAQs</span>
    <h1>Questions people often ask</h1>
    <p class="ri-muted mb-0" style="max-width: 44rem;">How quotes, payment, rental times and delivery work at Rent It.BB.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="s_accordion o_colored_level ri-section ri-faq" data-snippet="s_accordion" data-name="Accordion">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="row g-4">
      <div class="col-lg-8">
        <div class="accordion" id="ri-faq">
          <div class="accordion-item" data-name="Accordion Item">
            <h2 class="accordion-header" id="ri-faq-h1"><button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#ri-faq-1" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="ri-faq-1">How do I place a booking?</button></h2>
            <div id="ri-faq-1" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" aria-labelledby="ri-faq-h1" data-bs-parent="#ri-faq" role="region">
              <div class="accordion-body">
                <p>Browse the collection and add what you need to your quote. Then continue to your quote and complete a short form with your event details. We&#8217;ll check that everything is available and email your official quote to look over and approve.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="accordion-item" data-name="Accordion Item">
            <h2 class="accordion-header" id="ri-faq-h2"><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#ri-faq-2" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="ri-faq-2">When do I pay for my order?</button></h2>
            <div id="ri-faq-2" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="ri-faq-h2" data-bs-parent="#ri-faq" role="region">
              <div class="accordion-body">
                <p>A 50% deposit holds your items. It&#8217;s due once you approve your quote, and it is non-refundable. The rest of your order is due 5 days before your event date.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="accordion-item" data-name="Accordion Item">
            <h2 class="accordion-header" id="ri-faq-h3"><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#ri-faq-3" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="ri-faq-3">How long do I keep the items?</button></h2>
            <div id="ri-faq-3" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="ri-faq-h3" data-bs-parent="#ri-faq" role="region">
              <div class="accordion-body">
                <p>All our prices are for up to 24 hours, from delivery to pick-up. Need something for longer? Just ask, and we&#8217;ll do our best to work something out.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="accordion-item" data-name="Accordion Item">
            <h2 class="accordion-header" id="ri-faq-h4"><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#ri-faq-4" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="ri-faq-4">Do you deliver?</button></h2>
            <div id="ri-faq-4" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="ri-faq-h4" data-bs-parent="#ri-faq" role="region">
              <div class="accordion-body">
                <p>Yes. Our team delivers, sets up and collects every order, island-wide. Items can&#8217;t be collected from us at this time. The delivery fee is added to your quote.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="accordion-item" data-name="Accordion Item">
            <h2 class="accordion-header" id="ri-faq-h5"><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#ri-faq-5" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="ri-faq-5">What if my event is cancelled or moved because of weather?</button></h2>
            <div id="ri-faq-5" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="ri-faq-h5" data-bs-parent="#ri-faq" role="region">
              <div class="accordion-body">
                <p>If bad weather or something unexpected gets in the way, talk to us and we&#8217;ll work with you. Please note that all deposits are non-refundable, whatever the reason.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="accordion-item" data-name="Accordion Item">
            <h2 class="accordion-header" id="ri-faq-h6"><button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#ri-faq-6" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="ri-faq-6">How far ahead should I book?</button></h2>
            <div id="ri-faq-6" class="accordion-collapse collapse" aria-labelledby="ri-faq-h6" data-bs-parent="#ri-faq" role="region">
              <div class="accordion-body">
                <p>Send us your request as soon as you have your event details. That way we can check stock and make sure what you need is free on your date.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-4">
        <div class="ri-help">
          <h3 class="h5">Still have a question?</h3>
          <p class="ri-muted">Send us a note and we&#8217;ll be happy to help.</p>
          <div class="d-grid gap-2">
            <a class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" href="__PAGE:contactus__">Contact us</a>
          </div>
          <p class="ri-muted small mt-3 mb-0">You can also email <a href="mailto:contact@rentit.bb">contact@rentit.bb</a> or WhatsApp <a href="https://wa.me/12462348230" target="_blank" rel="noopener">+1 (246) 234-8230</a>.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ri-note mt-3">Ready to start? <a href="__SHOP__">Browse the collection</a> and request your quote online.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
